Package: phasealign
Version: __VERSION__
Section: sound
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Leigh Pierce <leighpierce@me.com>
Description: Phase Align plugin (VST3)
 Phase alignment utility: variable all-pass or constant phase rotation, a
 -4 to +4 ms delay in 0.1-sample steps, polarity and a correlation meter,
 built with JUCE.
